* Option file 1 for CPLEX solver. For possible options, see the GAMS Solver Manual. Change as needed.

LPmethod        4       * Use barrier
BarCrossAlg     1       * Let CPLEX choose best crossover method
BarHomogeneous  1       * Improves stability in tough models
BarConvTol   1e-6       * Slightly relaxed, still acceptable for most use
AggFill        50       * Moderate fill-in to balance speed and stability
AdvInd          1       * Try advanced basis for better crossover
Scaling 1        * Let CPLEX rescale the model automatically